      "text": "[Inputs]: task, browser, max_steps\n[Step-by-Step Action Loop]:\n• Step Obs: url, axtree [bid], error\n• Solver LLM -> {\n    'thought': 'click add to cart..',\n    'action': 'click(\"45\")'\n  }\n[Outputs]:\n• steps: list[Step]\n• success: bool, infeasible: bool\n• urls_seen: set[str]",
