      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1000,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[Inputs]: SkillCard + boundary axtrees\n[Mechanism]:\n• OperatorInducer: Rút trích NL Pre/Eff\n• PredicateRegistry: Chuẩn hóa NL\n  thành Canonical Predicate IDs (p0, p1..)\n• Grounding Verifier: Kiểm tra độ chính\n  xác effect trên mọi member (>= 50%)\n[Output]: Operator(name, pre, eff)",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[Inputs]: SkillCard + boundary axtrees\n[Mechanism]:\n• OperatorInducer: Rút trích NL Pre/Eff\n• PredicateRegistry: Chuẩn hóa NL\n  thành Canonical Predicate IDs (p0, p1..)\n• Grounding Verifier: Kiểm tra độ chính\n  xác effect trên mọi member (>= 50%)\n[Output]: Operator(name, pre, eff)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
